00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:07.040
And while it started with just being like a way of visualizing the

138
00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.760
agents — number one, like, just where are they?

139
00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.840
Which ones exist, which one is which. Right.

